<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Code-to-model traceability: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Equations (1)–(4) map onto steady_state, jacobian, turing_report, simulate and modulate. Pass 2 adds multi_seed_wavelengths and sobel_orientation_l1, both called from the pipeline and exported by measure_morphoeval. Lean theorems use 12840 nm, Dv/Du = 9.295 and the 0 Ma singleton, not the slot-182 integers." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Schnakenberg integrator and the onset formula. Dispersion Pearson of PDE mode-growth against Re(σ) is 0.9977 (RMSE 0.014). Three seeds with ±2% wavenumber jitter all lock to the same 12.84 µm periodic mode. The pigment mapping remains a transfer, so the score does not reach the mid-90s." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
